{'symbol': 'MDT', 'date': '2021-11-15 11:00:00', 'title': 'MEDTRONIC ANNOUNCES 510(K) CLEARANCE FOR PILLCAM™ SMALL BOWEL 3 @HOME ENDOSCOPY PROCEDURE', 'text': "DUBLIN, NOV. 15, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- MEDTRONIC PLC (NYSE:MDT),\xa0A GLOBAL LEADER IN HEALTHCARE TECHNOLOGY,\xa0TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT THE U.S. FOOD AND DRUG ADMINISTRATION (FDA) HAS GRANTED 510(K) CLEARANCE FOR ITS PILLCAM™ SMALL BOWEL 3 SYSTEM FOR REMOTE ENDOSCOPY PROCEDURES. THE PILLCAM™ SB3 @HOME PROGRAM COMBINES MEDTRONIC'S PILLCAM TECHNOLOGY WITH AMAZON LOGISTICS, A COMBINATION INTENDED TO ENSURE BOTH TIMELY AND ACCURATE RESULTS FOR PATIENTS FROM THE COMFORT OF THEIR HOMES."}{'symbol': 'MDT', 'date': '2021-11-15 06:45:00', 'title': 'MEDTRONIC NAMED TO THE DOW JONES SUSTAINABILITY WORLD INDEX', 'text': "DUBLIN, NOV. 15, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0MEDTRONIC PLC (NYSE:MDT), A GLOBAL LEADER IN HEALTHCARE TECHNOLOGY, TODAY ANNOUNCED ITS INCLUSION IN THE DOW JONES® SUSTAINABILITY WORLD INDEX (DJSI WORLD) AS ONE OF THE WORLD'S LEADING COMPANIES FOR SUSTAINABILITY. THE DJSI WORLD INDEX INCLUDES A SELECT GROUP OF COMPANIES BASED ON THEIR PERFORMANCE ACROSS A VARIETY OF SUSTAINABILITY CRITERIA, INCLUDING ECONOMIC PERFORMANCE, ENVIRONMENTAL STEWARDSHIP, SOCIAL RESPONSIBILITY, AND CORPORATE GOVERNANCE."}